  "title": "Fix Clang analyzer issues with thrift_field_header_t",
  "description": "Clang analyzer does not consider the memset in dissect_thrift_field_header\nto be sufficient to set the field that is read later.\nThe analysis also misses the fact that the value is overwritten in all\nnon-error cases (and error cases avoid the notified lines).\n\n@alagoutte Apart from waiting for the analysis result, no additional work is expected and all 3 reports should be fixed.",
